  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1109.10 Complaints and Hearing. Complaints shall be received and administrative hearings shall be conducted in accordance with the procedures set forth in RSA 541-A: 29, Fis 200, and Fis 1800.\n\nSource. #12785, eff 5-22-19",
